# Sharing

A `?wohnung=` link may carry only purchase price, state, notary, broker, and owner costs. The server drops every other field.

`/api/profile` reads a file only when `BUY_VS_RENT_PROFILE` is set. Otherwise it is 404. Tests never read `private/profile.yaml`.
